<title>TUNISIA: Libyan army chief visits Tunisia.</title>
<headline>Libyan army chief visits Tunisia.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Libyan army's acting chief, Colonel Abu Bakr Jaber Yunes, on Monday arrived in Tunis for talks with Tunisian officials, diplomatic sources said.</p>
<p>They said Yunes, coordinator of the three-man General Provisional Committee which heads the Libyan army, was greeted on his arrival by Tunisian Defence Minister Habib Ben Yahia.</p>
</text>
